---
description: Build Spec immutability and rebaseline rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- build-spec/CURRENT.json names the only active baseline.
- Baselines are immutable after merge to main.
- Activation Records are append-only governance artifacts.
- Never create, edit, approve, or forge build-spec/activations/*.json as Cursor.
- Never edit an old baseline to make tests pass.
- Never reinterpret a contract because implementation is difficult.
- Never remove an Acceptance/Test obligation without an approved rebaseline.
- Never switch build-spec/CURRENT.json directly.

Approved rebaseline:
1. affected Sprint is BLOCKED first when a Sprint exists;
2. approved DESIGN_DELTA exists with explicit User decision reference;
3. Product Working is changed and approved;
4. old baseline remains unchanged;
5. a new BS-* baseline is added with supersedes + approved delta IDs;
6. Human governance adds matching Activation Record;
7. CURRENT changes to the new baseline in the governed change;
8. Backlog/tasks are explicitly rebound;
9. all Harness gates pass before implementation resumes.
